<div class="anh-slide uml"><img src="https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SWD392/uml/592b2d414a873fe35dc99c29cc310c017071eaf8.svg" alt="Mediator — a list selection updates the entry field through the director (GoF, Motivation)" loading="lazy" /><p class="chu-thich">🧩 Mediator — a list selection updates the entry field through the director (GoF, Motivation)</p></div>
